Error [jet.FallbackTypeMismatch]: `??` only works on a fallible value, not `Loc`
  --> Tests/UI/nested_interpolation_span.jet:8:48
    |
  8 |     "{if location == None -> "None" else -> "{(location ?? Loc{line: 0}).line}"}"
    |                                                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The left side must be a `Result` or optional value
 Fix: Call something that can fail, then write `... ?? fallback`
